nt equation relating ${u}_{1}^{′}$ and ${u}_{2}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n{{field-4}}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374947 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "261b9603-2ac4-5d0d-8b8b-1dfa9f08009a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374947 #edb/ref 1074 "Given a second-order linear inhomogeneous differential equation, the variation of parameters method requires that we seek a particular solution of the form\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}(x)={u}_{1}(x){y}_{1}(x)+{u}_{2}(x){y}_{2}(x)\n$$\n\nthat satisfies the constraint\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}^{′}={u}_{1}{y}_{1}^{′}+{u}_{2}{y}_{2}^{′}.\n$$\n\nHere, ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}$ are linearly independent solutions of the corresponding homogeneous equation, and ${u}_{1}$ and ${u}_{2}$ are functions to be determined.\n\nIn this case, we're told that the fundamental solutions are\n\n$$\n{y}_{1}={e}^{2x},\\,{y}_{2}={e}^{-x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the fundamental solutions into our expression for ${y}_{p},$ we get\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}={u}_{1}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}{e}^{-x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the fundamental solutions into our constraint equation for ${y}_{p}^{′},$ we get\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}^{′}={u}_{1}({e}^{2x})^{′}+{u}_{2}({e}^{-x})^{′}.\n$$\n\nWe can form a constraint that relates ${u}_{1}^{′}$ and ${u}_{2}^{′}$ by differentiating ${y}_{p}$ and equating this expression to our constraint on ${y}_{p}^{′}.$\n\nDifferentiating ${y}_{p}$ with respect to $x$ using the product rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}^{′} & ={({u}_{1}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}{e}^{-x})}^{′} \\\\  & ={({u}_{1}{e}^{2x})}^{′}+{({u}_{2}{e}^{-x})}^{′} \\\\  & ={u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{1}({e}^{2x})^{′}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}+{u}_{2}({e}^{-x})^{′} \\\\  & ={u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+2{u}_{1}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}-{u}_{2}{e}^{-x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we equate our two expressions for ${y}_{p}^{′},$ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+2{u}_{1}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}-{u}_{2}{e}^{-x} & ={u}_{1}({e}^{2x})^{′}+{u}_{2}({e}^{-x})^{′} \\\\ {u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+2{u}_{1}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}-{u}_{2}{e}^{-x} & =2{u}_{1}{e}^{2x}-{u}_{2}{e}^{-x} \\\\ {u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+\\cancel{2{u}_{1}{e}^{2x}}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}-\\cancel{{u}_{2}{e}^{-x}} & =\\cancel{2{u}_{1}{e}^{2x}}-\\cancel{{u}_{2}{e}^{-x}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich finally gives\n\n$$\n{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}=0.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374949 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374950 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374951 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374952 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1077 "field-4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186374952 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374948 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7e026e97-5794-51fb-86a2-0dc613e2d92b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374949 #edb/ref 1080 "{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}-{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374949 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374949 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fb66feb1-842a-531b-951e-b8b34c2d545f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374950 #edb/ref 1080 "{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}-2{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374950 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374950 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "552e562e-794c-57c0-acfd-0da57f0138fd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374951 #edb/ref 1080 "2{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374951 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374951 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9d6746de-cd44-5d9c-a20b-248ce818ab04" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374952 #edb/ref 1080 "{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{2x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374952 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186374952 #edb/ref 108